3️⃣ SRS – Software Requirement Specification
System Overview

A Power BI–based analytics system to analyze PhonePe business transaction data.

Functional Requirements

Import multiple datasets (Users, Transactions, Services)

Clean and transform data using Power Query

Generate automated visual dashboards

Support service-wise, monthly, and failure analysis

Non-Functional Requirements

Performance: Dashboards should load within 5 seconds

Usability: Simple and interactive UI

Scalability: Ability to add future service datasets

Reliability: Accurate and consistent reporting

Tools & Technology

Power BI

Excel

Power Query
